          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "side d.",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>cup and by its contents, according to the Torah</li>\n<li>and halakha, according to the law of Moses and Israel.\"</li>\n<li>And he hands to her the edge of the marriage contract.</li>\n<li>And he gives the groom to drink from the cup.</li>\n<li>He lets go of the marriage contract, and he begins&nbsp;</li>\n<li>to give the bride the cup to drink.</li>\n<li>And he says to her, \"Take this cup</li>\n<li>and this marriage contract, so that you will be to me&mdash;</li>\n<li>and you will enter by (receiving) them&mdash;as wife&mdash;into jurisdiction&mdash;</li>\n<li>by it, to me as wife&mdash;according to the Torah and halakha,</li>\n<li>according to the law of Moses and Israel, in complete</li>\n<li>qiddushin.\" May they build and prosper!</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
